  "description": "Server-authoritative entity replication for SetNet: fixed-rate, delta-compressed world snapshots over the unreliable channel with reliable spawns/despawns, client-side interpolation, interest management, and an input channel for client prediction. Engine-agnostic core (headless dedicated server + any .NET client); the Unity binding (SetNet.StateSync.Unity) adds NetworkObject/NetworkTransform/NetworkAnimator/NetworkRigidbody. Composition, no base class. Depends only on SetNet.",
